[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0424","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0424.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0951","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Internet Key Exchange 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 的 Internet 密钥交换（IKE）协议实现存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统的 UDP 500 端口发送大量包含点号（.）字符的畸形数据包，导致系统 CPU 资源被耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 系列操作系统，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可发起攻击，利用门槛低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0951"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:17Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-011 对应的更新补丁，或升级至 Windows XP 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上限制 UDP 500 端口的入站流量速率，或使用 IPsec 策略过滤异常 IKE 数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100774842520403&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100813081913496&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3652","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7667","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21172","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-0951.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0951.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0951","https://github.com/nbrito/research/blob/f070ce78f917d962de8df74cc7a841f1cbbcfa00/cve/CVE-2001-0951/nb-isakmp.pl","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0951.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0951.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h4w9-fjxr-9vf9/GHSA-h4w9-fjxr-9vf9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0951.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0424.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0393","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0857","title":"Horde IMP 跨站脚本会话劫持漏洞","description":"tags.<value>IMP Webmail（Horde 项目的一部分）2.2.6 及更早版本中的 status.php3 脚本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 URL 并向 message 参数注入 JavaScript 代码，诱骗已登录用户访问该页面，从而在用户浏览器中执行恶意脚本并窃取其会话 Cookie。攻击者利用获取的会话 Cookie 即可劫持其他用户会话，无需密码即可登录目标账户，查看、转发或删除邮件内容，甚至获取邮件中存储的敏感个人信息。该漏洞影响 Horde IMP 2.2.x 系列，攻击条件为攻击者能够诱导已认证用户点击恶意链接，利用门槛较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0857"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Horde IMP 2.2.7 版本，该版本已修复 status.php3 中的跨站脚本漏洞。升级方式：从 ftp://ftp.horde.org/pub/imp/ 下载 imp-2.2.7.tar.gz 并覆盖安装，或使用 patch-imp-2.2.6-2.2.7.gz 补丁进行热修复。同时配置 session.cookie_httponly=1 和 session.use_strict_mode=1 以增强会话 cookie 安全性，临时缓解措施还包括在 Web 服务器层面禁用 status.php3 的 GET 参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000437","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100535679608486&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100540578822469&w=2","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-039.0.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/668","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3525","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7496","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21151","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8c474180208f952ad61aa8eca8d07115fb6f16a5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0857.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0857","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6407093a9e2b3e61a3960c2e290e4a0a028bf4e0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0857.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4190a549751bffc11b00246a033a062f4109e196/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0857.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q4p-cfxj-gj9f/GHSA-6q4p-cfxj-gj9f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/imp_session_hijacking.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0857.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0857.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0391","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0855","title":"Rational ClearCase DB Loader TERM 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.x 及更早版本中的 db_loader 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。程序在处理 TERM 环境变量时未正确校验长度，本地攻击者可通过设置过长的 TERM 环境变量触发栈溢出，进而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 ClearCase 4.2 及更早版本（含 3.2/4.x），攻击条件为具备本地用户权限且无需额外认证；成功利用后可完全破坏机密性、完整性与可用性，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级高。\"\"\"\n```\n\nI see the problem - the description field has a newline and then `<value>` inside the triple quotes, which would make the description start with \"Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.\" followed by a newline and then the actual content. Actually wait, looking more carefully:\n\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\nRational ClearCase 3.2/4.\n\n<value>Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.x 及更早版本中的 db_loader 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。...\n```\n\nThis seems like a malformed TOML/insertion. The description string contains \"Rational ClearCase 3.2/4.\" on one line, then a blank line, then `<value>Rational...` \n\nBut the task says the error is `description: description 字段为空`. This might mean the validator sees the description as empty for some reason, or there might be parsing issues.\n\nWait, the task asks me to fix the description field. The content between `<value>` and `\n","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0855"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06Z","remediation":"将 Rational ClearCase 从受影响的 3.2/4.0/4.1/4.2 及更早版本升级到 4.2 之后的修复版本；若无法立即升级，以 root 执行 chmod a-s /usr/atria/etc/db_loader 去掉 setuid 位，并限制普通用户执行该程序及本地登录权限，防止通过超长 TERM 环境变量触发溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100528623328037&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7488.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3523","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21150","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0855.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0855","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0855.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0855.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wq48-hj2m-499j/GHSA-wq48-hj2m-499j.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0855.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0855.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0391.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0388","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0388.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0839","title":"iBill iBill Management Script 弱硬编码密码漏洞","description":"标签中。<value>iBill 密码管理系统的 CGI 脚本 ibillpm.pl 存在弱密码漏洞，该脚本使用客户的 MASTER_ACCOUNT 名称加上两个小写字母作为默认认证密码。由于 MASTER_ACCOUNT 可以从站点注册页面的 HTML 隐藏表单字段中公开获取，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在有限密码空间（最多 676 种组合）内通过暴力破解方式猜解出正确的认证密码。攻击成功后，攻击者可通过该 CGI 脚本向目标服务器的 .htpasswd 文件发送特制 POST 请求，执行添加用户、删除用户或修改密码等操作，从而完全控制网站的用户认证体系并进行未授权访问。该漏洞影响以默认配置部署 iBill 密码管理系统 CGI 脚本的网站。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0839"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:04Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 iBill 密码管理系统至最新版本（建议升级至 2001 年 12 月后发布的修复版本），并立即修改 MASTER_ACCOUNT 默认主账户密码为强密码（≥12 位含大小写数字特殊字符）。若无法立即升级，请在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache/.htaccess）限制 ibillpm.pl 仅允许受信 IP 访问，并禁用弱密码生成逻辑，强制启用强密码策略。同时检查 .htpasswd 文件是否已被篡改，必要时重置所有账户密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100404371423927&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3476","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7352","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21129","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0839.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0839","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0839.md","https://