y":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0836"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Oracle9iAS Web Cache 2.0.1.0 或更高版本（需联系 Oracle 获取补丁补丁集 Patchset 2.0.1.0 或更高版本）。若无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制对 Web Cache 管理端口（默认 4000/4001/4002）和 HTTP 端口（默认 7777/7778）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 访问；同时在 Web Cache 配置文件 webcache.xml 中限制最大 HTTP 请求长度（设置 <MAX_REQUEST_LENGTH> 限制 URL 长度），并禁用不必要的管理端口对外暴露。若业务允许，建议迁移至 Oracle Web Cache 10g/11g 或更高版本并及时应用 Oracle 官方安全补丁（参考 Oracle Critical Patch Update 补丁）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100342151132277&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100395487007578&w=2","http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/webcache.pdf","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-29.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/649979","http://www.osvdb.org/5534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7306","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21121","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0836.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0836.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0836","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0836.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0836.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jff3-2vxf-7gwc/GHSA-jff3-2vxf-7gwc.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/oracle9iAS_too_long_url.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/www_too_long_useragent.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0384.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0384.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0383","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0383.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1247","title":"PHP PHP 4.0.4pl1/4.0.5 安全模式文件访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 4.0.4pl1 和 4.0.5 在安全模式下存在文件访问控制漏洞，远程攻击者可上传包含 error_log 函数的 PHP 脚本，绕过安全模式限制读取和写入 Web 服务器 UID 拥有的文件。该漏洞源于安全模式未正确限制 error_log 函数的文件操作权限，攻击者仅需上传恶意脚本即可远程利用，无需认证，攻击复杂度低。影响 PHP 4.0.4pl1 和 4.0.5 版本，CVSS 评分 6.4（中等），影响机密性和完整性，不影响可用性。攻击者可利用此漏洞读取敏感文件或写入恶意文件，进一步控制 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1247"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:53Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PHP 至 4.0.6 或更高版本（推荐升级至 PHP 5.6+ / 7.x / 8.x 版本），PHP 5.3+ 已废弃安全模式，5.4+ 已彻底移除。无法立即升级时，请在 php.ini 中设置 disable_functions = error_log, fopen, fwrite, file_put_contents 禁用危险函数，并设置 open_basedir 限制 PHP 脚本仅能访问指定目录，同时设置正确的文件系统权限，确保 Web 服务器进程 UID 仅拥有必要的最小读写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194425","http://www.osvdb.org/5440","http://www.php.net/do_download.php?download_file=php-4.1.2.tar.gz","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-035.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1247.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1247","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2001/