ty Vulnerability)。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 otrcrep 可执行文件的执行权限（chmod 700 $ORACLE_HOME/bin/otrcrep），并限制 ORACLE_HOME 环境变量长度不超过 256 字符。建议限制非授权用户对 Oracle 安装目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100386756715645&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/201295","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/222612","http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/otrcrep.pdf","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-011.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3139","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6940","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21045","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0833.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0833","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0833.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0833.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3cfx-pw87-g2gg/GHSA-3cfx-pw87-g2gg.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0833.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0833.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0382.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0380","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0380.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0830","title":"6Tunnel 6tunnel 连接断开状态拒绝服务漏洞","description":"6Tunnel 0.08 及更早版本存在资源释放缺陷（CWE-772），未正确关闭客户端发起的 Socket 连接。远程未认证攻击者可通过反复建立并断开 TCP 连接，导致服务端文件描述符耗尽，引发拒绝服务（资源耗尽）。该漏洞影响 6Tunnel 0.6/0.7/0.8 版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需权限、无需用户交互，仅影响可用性（A:H）。攻击者只需持续发起 TCP 连接并立即断开，即可耗尽服务端文件描述符资源，导致合法连接无法建立。ExploitDB（EDB-21126）已公开 PoC 利用代码，攻击者可直接利用实施 DoS 攻击。升级至 6Tunnel 0.09 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0830"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:02Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 6tunnel 至 0.09 或更高版本（已修复 socket 未正确关闭导致的资源耗尽漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制单 IP 连接频率（如 iptables 限制每分钟新建连接数），或在系统层面调整 TCP 连接超时参数（如降低 tcp_fin_timeout、启用 tcp_tw_reuse）缓解资源耗尽风险。长期建议升级至官方最新稳定版并监控连接数异常。建议立即升级 6tunnel 至 0.09 或更高版本（已修复 socket 未正确关闭导致的资源耗尽漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制单 IP 连接频率（如 iptables 限制每分钟新建连接数），或在系统层面调整 TCP 连接超时参数（如降低 tcp_fin_timeout、启用 tcp_tw_reuse）缓解资源耗尽风险。长期建议升级至官方最新稳定版并监控连接数异常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100386451702966&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3467","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7337","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21126","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0830.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0830","https://github.com/yaklang/yakit/blob/52a0094eccfbc0d3c5caff88cab946af323fb8df/app/renderer/src/main/src/pages/cve/CVEDescription.tsx","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0830.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0830.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x6j7-c99q-rch9/GHSA-x6j7-c99q-rch9.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0830.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0380.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0377","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0377.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0823","title":"SGI Performance Co-Pilot pmpost 符号链接权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI Performance Co-Pilot (PCP) 2.1.x/2.2 版本中的 pmpost 程序存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 PCP 日志目录（PCP_LOG_DIR）中对 NOTICES 文件创建恶意符号链接，利用 pmpost 程序以特权写入任意文件，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 PCP 2.2.1-3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击需要本地访问权限且无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。SGI 已在 PCP 2.2.1-3 版本中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0823"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:01Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SGI Performance Co-Pilot (PCP) 至 2.2.1-3 或更高版本修复 pmpost 符号链接漏洞。具体操作步骤：1. 从 SGI 官方补丁站点 ftp://patches.sgi.com/support/free/security/advisories/20010601-01-A 获取官方补丁包；2. 停止 PCP 相关服务（如 pcp、pmcd、pmlogger 等）；3. 解压并安装补丁包到系统中；4. 重启 PCP 服务使补丁生效；5. 验证 pmpost 程序不再存在符号链接攻击漏洞。若无法立即升级，可临时移除 pmpost 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/share/pcp/bin/pmpost）或限制 PCP_LOG_DIR 目录权限防止符号链接攻击作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http