tps://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0818.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73a8b58807bbd8e2a24b27e9365e9527f4708b8f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0818.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b6e012a8b6927ff0421192ff5550ae507d8e884/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jh4f-cp39-x2ff/GHSA-jh4f-cp39-x2ff.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0818.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2867/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0818.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0366","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0815","title":"ActiveState ActivePerl 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ActiveState ActivePerl 5.6.1.629 及更早版本中的 PerlIS.dll 组件存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。该组件在处理以 .pl 为扩展名的 HTTP 请求时，未正确校验文件名长度，攻击者可构造包含超长文件名的恶意请求触发溢出。漏洞影响在 IIS 等 Web 服务器上通过 PerlIS 运行 Perl 脚本的 ActivePerl 环境。攻击条件为网络可达且目标站点启用了 .pl 脚本映射，无需身份认证。成功利用可导致远程任意代码执行，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0815"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00Z","remediation":"升级到 ActivePerl 5.6.1 build 630 或更高版本以修复 perlIIS.dll 缓冲区溢出漏洞。在 IIS 管理器中，确保\"检查文件是否存在\"(Verify that file exists)选项处于启用状态作为临时缓解措施，该选项默认启用但被攻击者利用时需将其关闭。同时限制 IIS 对 .pl 扩展名的 ISAPI 处理权限，仅允许可信目录执行 Perl 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.activestate.com/show_bug.cgi?id=18062","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100583978302585&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/678","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3526","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7539","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21153","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0815.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cee83846410898acfe082d5ef5a9cde6a9d8b33c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0815.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0815","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2001-0815.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/26bf82f4a19fc2d731fb6ea3f027707d0e70bd44/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0815.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/2089ff7201b44e5e462742a5baaa080ba003d257/util/cve-to-ghad","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0815.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f1681edc3f70c2637ccb21590e6662de194aa5b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5px-j32w-fcqp/GHSA-c5px-j32w-fcqp.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/perlIS_dll_bufferoverflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0366.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0366.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0365","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0805","title":"Tarantella Enterprise 3 任意文件查看漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Tarantella Enterprise 3.00/3.01 的 ttawebtop.cgi 存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 pg 参数中插入 \"..\"（点号）构造恶意请求，绕过目录访问限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Tarantella Enterprise 3.00 和 3.01 版本，攻击者利用此漏洞可获取系统配置文件、敏感数据等未授权信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0805"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:59Z","remediation":"如果使用的是 Tarantella Enterprise 3.00 或 3.01，应立即联系 Tarantella（原 SCO）获取安全补丁并升级到修复版本。如暂无法升级，应将 ttawebtop.cgi 从 /cgi-bin 目录中移除，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 .htaccess 或 RewriteRule）禁止外部访问该脚本。同时可在防火墙或反向代理层拦截对 /ttawebtop.cgi 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/20010619150935.A5226%40tarantella.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/3B2E37D0.81D9ED9D%40snosoft.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2890","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6723","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20940","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/443201f18f73f1db21c099e42f4e1967b96993dc/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0805.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0805","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0805.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9f14dd7a1c5691895422a824762c1dbc0caf1d9a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0805.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a296135b4fb6684177b1ef84e538a96d91a93adb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2qm4-5wpq-jgj4/GHSA-2qm4-5wpq-jgj4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0805.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/ttawebtop.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0365.toml"}]